  nonce: 503a  # 503a
  data:  # 503a
    kind: work_item  # 503a
    title: "js-module-linker: module_exports never reaches an exported non-callable binding (export const store = {...}; koel: 0 of 111 exported variables), so an import of a store module reaches neither the store nor its methods"  # 503a
    status: todo_hard  # 503a
    priority: 3  # 503a
    parent:  # 503a
    tags:  # 503a
    - javascript  # 503a
    - linker_infrastructure  # 503a
    isbefore: []  # 503a
    duplicate_of: []  # 503a
    not_duplicate_of: []  # 503a
    pr_ref:  # 503a
    description: "FOUND 2026-10-01 by WI-sinol (branch jgstern-agent/fix/sinol), measured on koel.\n\nTHE GAP. module_exports is emitted only for kinds in js_module.py `_EXPORTABLE_KINDS` = {function, method, class, getter, setter, constructor}. An exported NON-callable binding -- `export const playlistStore = { ... }`, `export const http = new Http()`, `module.exports = sharp` where sharp is a variable -- is part of the module's public surface (the module_exports definition in edge_types.py: \"Module exposes a symbol as part of its public surface\") but never gets the edge.\n\nWHY IT SURFACED NOW. Before WI-sinol the linker sent module_exports to EVERY symbol of an exportable kind, so a koel store's object-literal methods (e.g. radioStationStore.ts `byId`) were reached file -> method directly, by accident. WI-sinol gates the edge on is_exported is True, which those methods are not (they are members of an exported object, not exports). A traversal a.ts -imports-> store.ts -module_exports-> ? now reaches neither the store nor its methods.\n\nNUMBERS (koel, WI-sinol branch survey): 111 JS/TS variables carry is_exported=True; 0 of them have a module_exports edge, before or after WI-sinol.\n\nDECISION NEEDED: add `variable` (and possibly `constant`) to the kinds the edge may reach, and whether an exported object literal should `contains` its methods so traversal continues. Not measured: the effect on slice / reverse-slice output.\nRelated: WI-sinol."  # 503a
    fields: {}  # 503a
- op: discuss  # 32ef
  at: '2026-11-01T10:56:14Z'  # 32ef
  by: agent  # 32ef
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 32ef
  clock: 2  # 32ef
  nonce: 32ef  # 32ef
  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/pyjs1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. js_module.py _EXPORTABLE_KINDS unchanged @100b6fbb6e. Fixture fx_gafaj: `export const playlistStore = {byId(){}, all(){}}` + `export function helper()`; playlistStore is_exported=True but module_exports reaches only helper. Narrower consequence than the title says: a.ts's playlistStore.byId('x') still has a resolved calls edge to byId, and the file contains both playlistStore and its methods, so the module_exports traversal is what misses them, not every traversal. koel counts not re-measured. MECHANISM: js_module _EXPORTABLE_KINDS excludes variable/constant, so an is_exported=True variable never gets module_exports. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-rabod,WI-kodop."  # 32ef
